              10 LINHA OCCURS 6 TIMES.
                 15 CELULA OCCURS 6 TIMES   PIC X.
           05 VISIVEL.
              10 LINHA-V OCCURS 6 TIMES.
                 15 CELULA-V OCCURS 6 TIMES PIC X.
           05 PONTUACAO                    PIC 9(05).
